{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Miner Crysis \u2013 Demo Description</strong><br><i>Descend. Discover. Survive.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Miner Crysis</strong> is a 2D sci-fi mining adventure where you pilot a customizable drill-ship beneath the surface of a dying moon. After being abandoned with only your AI companion for company, you must uncover buried secrets, gather precious resources, and survive the moon\u2019s growing dangers.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Demo Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Introductory Level</strong> \u2013 Begin your descent with the first story-driven level setting the stage for your mission.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Alien Threats</strong> \u2013 Encounter hostile lifeforms lurking in the depths.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Secrets &amp; Unlocks</strong> \u2013 Discover hidden rooms and unlockables scattered throughout the underground.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Boss Fight</strong> \u2013 Face off against a powerful foe in an intense early-game boss battle.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Biome Progression</strong> \u2013 Travel through multiple underground environments, each with its own hazards and visuals.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Resource Gathering</strong> \u2013 Mine various ores and minerals to fuel upgrades and progression.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Story Reveal</strong> \u2013 Uncover the main plot and start piecing together the fate of the moon and its secrets.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Upgrades &amp; Quests</strong> \u2013 Customize your drill-ship, take on quests, and grow stronger to survive what lies ahead.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Prepare for danger, uncover ancient truths, and survive the depths in this gripping demo of <i>Miner Crysis</i>.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/store